#! seed 1861
# Civil War Strategy, a whole game as the Union to the time limit (QB64Rust's tools/screen/README.md,
# "Places and rules"). In the Utility menu: the enemy made passive (Aggress three times: normal, bold, reckless,
# passive), the balance Union +, and every end condition but the time turned off. Then the main menu's keys F3, F4
# and F7 (which ends the first turn), and END TURN at each of the other 23 main menus to January 1865, with a digest
# of each, the waits between answered by rules; in March 1865 the time runs out: the end screen, the Union Hall of
# Fame and its commander's name, Game Over, and Quit at the title menu. Display speed is not set: under a script TICK returns
# at once.

# The waits of the computer's turns: a space each (the pauses of place 1: R random events, P and B a battle, U and
# K the month's update, I, N and S events, H and G the high scores, F a report, L a long pause). A Retreat menu: the city it starts on. A main menu: END TURN;
# the End Turn and End Game menus: Yes; the Options at the end: Quit this Game.
rule 1:R key space
rule 1:P key space
rule 1:B key space
rule 1:U key space
rule 1:K key space
rule 1:I key space
rule 1:N key space
rule 1:S key space
rule 1:H key space
rule 1:G key space
rule 1:F key space
rule 1:L key space
rule 2:M text e
rule 2:E text y
rule 2:R key enter
rule 2:O text q

# The title menu: Start NEW Game.
play until 2:V
digest
text s
# The scenario menu: the Standard Map.
play until 2:S
text s
# March 1861, the main menu: UTILITY; Aggress three times; Balance: Union +; End Cond.
play until 2:M
digest
text u
prompt
text a
prompt
text a
prompt
text a
prompt
text b
prompt
text u
prompt
text e
# Victory Conditions, on Time: down and toggle each of the four others; out, and out of the Utility menu.
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
prompt
state
key esc
prompt
key esc
# The main menu's keys: F3 draws the screen again, F4 shows the force report (a key), F7 ends the turn at once.
prompt
key f3
prompt
digest
key f4
prompt
digest
key space
prompt
key f7
# 23 turns: the main menu, END TURN (and Yes by the rule).
repeat 23
play until 2:M
digest
text e
end
# March 1865: time expired; the End Game menu (Yes by the rule) and the Options: the screen behind them.
play until 2:O
state
text q
# The Union Hall of Fame: the commander's name.
play until 4
state
text Grant
key enter
# Game Over, and the title menu again: Quit; END's "Press any key to continue".
play until 2:V
state
text q
repeat space
